WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.230
<i>Horse girls.</i>

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.280
<i>They are born to run.</i>

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.760
<i>They inherit the names of 
horses from another world,</i>

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>This anime is a work of fiction that attempts to depict the stories behind real-world racehorses.</b>

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:17.310
<i>whose histories were sometimes tragic 
and sometimes wonderful, and race on.</i>

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:20.700
<i>That is their fate.</i>

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:27.680
<i>No one knows how the races waiting in the 
futures of these horse girls will end.</i>

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:34.970
<i>But they will continue to run, aiming only
 toward the goal in front of them.</i>

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:44.190
<b>Tokyo Racecourse</b>

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.460
Coming around the third turn 
and going into the fourth,

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:44.530
Symboli Rudolf has remained in 7th or 8th place,
 and has yet to make any major moves.

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:47.060
They're going around the fourth 
turn, and they're clear of it!

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.020
Entering the final stretch now,

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.780
and Symboli Rudolf moves 
to the outside of the pack!

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.200
With 200 meters to go!

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.570
Rudolf is moving up! 
Pushing forward from the edge!

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.740
