You're all really lucky that 
I ended up as your trainer—

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.250
Have fun cleaning up.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:31.630
Teio...

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:39.270
The open campus was so much fun today!

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:41.430
And the kids were so cute.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.110
It makes me nostalgic.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:44.470
For what?

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.530
For the day we first met.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:51.860
It was after I had won the Derby, 
and was being interviewed by the press.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:56.770
I think you were about as old 
as the kids who came by today.

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:59.490
Yeah! When I was in elementary school.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.560
You were so cool back then, Prez!

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.000
Although you still are.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.010
How are you feeling? Do you 
think you can win the Derby?

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:10.490
I don't think anything! I <i>am</i> gonna win it.

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:12.310
That sounds promising.

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:14.670
Yeah, because I made a promise!

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:19.960
So I'm going to become a strong and cool 
horse girl, just like Symboli Rudolf-san!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:25.120
My goal is to win the Triple Crown 
 undefeated, just like you!

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:29.080
The second step is winning 
the Derby, so I have to win!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.870
Right. I'll be looking forward to it.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:39.030
<b>Umamusume</b>

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:39.030
<b><i>Pretty Derby</i></b>

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.400
Teio, move up to the front!

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.180
Okay!

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:49.450
Here I come!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.960
The last stretch of the Derby 
isn't gonna be this breezy, Teio!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.050
Move those legs!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.130
Man...

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:19.380
Wow...

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:22.410
Honestly, those two can be so childish.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.030
My eyes!

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:27.540
This is really good.

